+/*==============================================================================
+@file   licenses.c
+
+@author Daniel Zorychta
+
+@brief  Print licenses of the build (open source components and license texts).
+
+        MIT License
+
+        Copyright (C) 2026 Daniel Zorychta <daniel.zorychta@gmail.com>
